  "narrative": "Despite concrete signals of chemical activity on the battlefield, the weight of norms, potential sanctions, and practical delivery challenges keeps the probability of state-actor chemical weapons use in Ukraine before May 1, 2026 at a very low level (about 2%). Attribution uncertainties further temper the forecast.",
